# IslandRecent: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandRecent.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc island demo download
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc island demo wifi
wait 7
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
shot recent
note "Recent" + "Clear", three lines newest first, badge at each line's LEFT, title, detail, "now"; the list fades in
ptr glide 1140 110 200
wait 0.4
shot line-hover
note the time turned into an x
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot removed
note the line slid off and the rest moved up
ptr glide 900 110 200
ptr down
ptr glide 800 110 150
ptr up
wait 0.6
shot dragged
note dragged 100 px left: the line went
ptr glide 900 110 200
ptr down
ptr glide 870 110 300
ptr up
wait 0.6
shot spring-back
note 30 px slowly: it sprang back
ptr down
ptr glide 840 110 40
ptr up
wait 0.6
shot flicked
note a quick flick (>500 px/s) removed it
ipc island demo download
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ptr glide 1140 75 200
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot cleared
note Clear emptied the list
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
ipc timer toggle
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
ptr glide 783 20 200
wait 0.3
shot clock-reachable
note the top-left clock button is reachable (island stays open)
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot recent-over
note Recent shows in place of the timer row; the island kept its height
ipc timer reset
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1

look glass
ipc island demo download
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
ipc island dismissNewest
ipc island demo wifi
wait 7
